App Intents off a Mac.

The metadata action's command reads $SDKROOT, which only a Mac's Bazel sets
for Xcode actions: derive it from DEVELOPER_DIR and APPLE_SDK_PLATFORM when
unset. Give it, and the App Shortcuts Flexible Matching action, the
toolchain's files (apple_mac_toolchain_info.sdk_tool_files) as inputs, as
rules_apple_codesign_inputs_sdk_tools.patch does for the other xcrun-based
resource actions, so that xcrun and the tools it runs are in the sandbox.
The NL training tool runs xcrun from PATH rather than /usr/bin/xcrun.

